{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.e_infinity_identifications","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.e_infinity_identifications","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":19,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.e_infinity_identifications","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.e_infinity_identifications","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L82-L112","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nHaving established the GB spectral sequence exists and converges\n([GB spectral sequence](#prop:gb-spectral-sequence)), the remaining\ntask is to **identify** each $E_\\infty^{p, *}$ page with a specific\nmass-formula term from\n([unified knot mass](#thm:knot-mass-formula-unified)).  This\nproposition attempts that identification for all six terms, marking\nderivation status per term.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the full six-term conjunction as the\n    type of `def e_infinity_identifications` and derives it from the\n    `EInfinityIdentificationsContext` fields (§3b-cond conditional); the\n    conjectural content lives in those class fields, not in a `sorry`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:e-infinity-page-identifications","label":"prop:e-infinity-page-identifications","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/e-infinity-page-identifications.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_wenzl_bridge_correction_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_wenzl_bridge_correction_holds","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Witness for manuscript term 6 — the Wenzl-bridge `y_λ` correction.\n\n**Parameterised 2026-09-13.**  This was `claim_wenzl_bridge_correction\n: Prop` plus a witness of it: a field typed with the *universe* `Prop`,\nso the instance chose the proposition and `⟨True, trivial⟩` discharged\nthe pair, leaving term 6 of `e_infinity_identifications` unconditional.\nAs a parameter the proposition is fixed by the binder and visible in\nevery consumer's type.  The conjecture is untouched and still open. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_chirality_sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_chirality_sign","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Manuscript term 5 — chirality / sign factor: `chirality_sign ∈ {±1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.chirality_sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.chirality_sign","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Chirality / sign factor of the mass-formula term 5 (must be ±1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_brane_tower_pairwise","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_brane_tower_pairwise","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Manuscript term 3 — pairwise-product brane tower identification:\n`<tr_M, E_∞^{2, *}> = Σ_{i,j} Φ_q(|V̂_i| · |V̂_j|)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.brane_pairwise","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.brane_pairwise","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Pairwise-product brane contribution `Φ_q(|V̂_i| · |V̂_j|)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_brane_tower_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_brane_tower_single","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Manuscript term 2 — single-generator brane tower identification:\n`<tr_M, E_∞^{1, *}> = Σ_i Φ_q(|V̂_i|)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.brane_pairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.brane_pairing","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Single-generator brane contribution `Φ_q(|V̂_i|)` at index `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.n_branes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.n_branes","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Number of brane indices `i` in the single-generator brane tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_descended","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_descended","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.trM_T_w_abs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.trM_T_w_abs","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Manuscript term 1 (DERIVED) — descended `|tr_M(T_w)|`\nidentification with `E_∞^{0, *}` (encoded as the explicit value\nof `page_pairing 0`, which equals `|tr_M(T_w)|`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_mass_formula_unified","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.claim_mass_formula_unified","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Manuscript master identity:\n`m(ϱ) = Σ_p <tr_M, E_∞^{p,*}> + ribbon_closure + frobenius_co_casimir`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.frobenius_co_casimir","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.frobenius_co_casimir","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Frobenius co-Casimir contribution `m_e · τ(C_{dim_q})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.ribbon_closure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.ribbon_closure","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Ribbon-closure contribution `<tr_M ∘ (id ⊗ Θ), E_∞^{0, *}(T_w)>`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.n_pages","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.n_pages","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Number of pages in the finite truncation used to compute\n`m_total`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.page_pairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.page_pairing","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Per-page contribution `<tr_M, E_∞^{p, *}(T_w)>`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.m_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.m_total","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Total mass `m(ϱ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.EInfinityIdentificationsContext","kind":"class","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/e_infinity_identifications.lean#L23-L80","doc":"Abstract context for the `e_infinity_identifications` claim —\nmanuscript-themed typed fields below; sub-claims encode the six\n`E_∞^{p,*}` page identifications corresponding to the six mass-\nformula terms of `thm:knot-mass-formula-unified`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}